    '_p_p_div_style_text_align_justify_Konten_video_ini_dirancang_bagi_audiens_yang_menyukai_pendekatan_storytelling_secara_visual_Narasi_di_dalam_video_akan_mengupas_sejarah_secara_tuntas_mulai_dari_sejarah_pembubaran_Kabupaten_Limbangan_oleh_Daendels_asal_usul_penamaan_kota_Garut_yang_konon_berasal_dari_kata_Kakarut_tergores_jejak_awal_penyebaran_agama_Islam_di_wilayah_tersebut_hingga_cuplikan_video_langka_perbandingan_sudut_sudut_kota_Garut_di_masa_kolonial_versus_masa_kini_Then_and_Now_div_' => '<p></p>
<div style="text-align: justify;">This video content is designed for audiences who like a visual storytelling approach. The narrative in the video will examine history in its entirety - starting from the history of the dissolution of Limbangan Regency by Daendels, the origins of the name of the city of Garut which is said to come from the word Kakarut (scratched), early traces of the spread of Islam in the region, to rare video footage comparing corners of the city of Garut in the colonial era versus the present (Then and Now).</div>',
    'Memori_Hitam_Putih_Melacak_Kejayaan_Swiss_van_Java_di_Era_Kolonial' => 'Black and White Memories: Tracing the Success of "Swiss van Java" in the Colonial Era',
    'Napak_tilas_keindahan_tata_kota_dan_kehidupan_masyarakat_Kabupaten_Garut_tempo_dulu_yang_memikat_hati_bangsa_Eropa_' => 'Trace the beauty of the city layout and life of the people of Garut Regency in the past which captivated the hearts of Europeans.',
    '_p_style_text_align_justify_Konten_carousel_ini_akan_membawa_audiens_bernostalgia_melihat_wajah_Kabupaten_Garut_di_masa_lampau_Konten_ini_menceritakan_jejak_Garut_sejak_masa_kolonial_Belanda_mulai_dari_tata_ruang_kotanya_yang_asri_suasana_stasiun_kereta_api_bersejarah_yang_bahkan_pernah_dikunjungi_oleh_komedian_legendaris_Charlie_Chaplin_pada_tahun_1920_an_hingga_potret_aktivitas_masyarakat_lokal_Visual_ini_menjadi_bukti_sejarah_mengapa_Garut_dulunya_menjadi_kota_peristirahatan_paling_prestisius_bagi_kaum_elite_Eropa_di_Hindia_Belanda_br_p_' => '<p style="text-align: justify; ">This carousel content will bring the audience to reminisce about seeing the face of Garut Regency in the past. This content tells the traces of Garut since the Dutch colonial period, starting from the beautiful city layout, the atmosphere of the historic train station (which was even visited by the legendary comedian Charlie Chaplin in the 1920s), to portraits of local community activities. This visual is historical evidence of why Garut used to be the most prestigious resort city for the European elite in the Dutch East Indies.<br /></p>',
    'Video_Edukasi_Sejarah_Wilayah_Jawa_Barat_Bandung_Lautan_Api_' => 'Educational Video on the History of the West Java and Bandung Sea of ​​Fire Regions.',
